            I was browsing through Spotify one time when I stumbled across a live version of this
song by Matt Maher with an added Chorus of an old hymn at the end "Here I Am Lord" by
James Kilbane. It's a great way to lead into a time of reflection in a worship service I
have found, enjoy guys. God bless.

